  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Aseguramiento Universal en Salud (PAUS) Fase I</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Universal Health Insurance Program (PAUS) Phase I</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Aumentar el acceso de la poblacin vulnerable (quintiles 1 y 2 ms pobre) a servicios de salud, mediante el apoyo a la implementacin y expansin del Programa de Aseguramiento Universal de Salud del Gobierno Ecuatoriano.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To extend access to health services of vulnerable population (quintiles 1 and 2), by supporting the implementation and expansion of the Universal Health Insurance Program of the Ecuadorian Government.</narrative>
  </description>
